{"id":"oi_do","lemma":"oído","pos":"noun","rank":375,"glosses":["hearing","inner ear; ear (used to refer to the ear as an internal organ, or its function of hearing)"],"ipa":"/oˈido/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"oídos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-o%C3%ADdo.wav","formAudio":{"oídos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-o%C3%ADdos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"No lo he oído.","en":"I didn't hear it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70631"},{"text":"Cuéntamelo, soy todo oídos.","en":"Tell me. I'm all ears.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721133"},{"text":"Hemos oído un ruido.","en":"We heard a noise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550371"},{"text":"Hizo oídos sordos a mis ruegos.","en":"He was deaf to my pleas.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932210"},{"text":"Lo he oído todo.","en":"I've heard it all.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453806"}]}